    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: BELL_001
    speaker: Bellamy
    subtitle: You're late, Inspector. The fictional murder was scheduled for ten.
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Annoyed
    priority: MUST
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: BURR_002
    speaker: Burrows
    subtitle: Observe the stillness. The absence of breathing. Our hostess is a marvel.
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Smug
    priority: MUST
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: BELL_002
    speaker: Bellamy
    subtitle: Might we check whether she's actually breathing?
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Concerned
    priority: MUST
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: BURR_003
    speaker: Burrows
    subtitle: A detective must never leap to conclusions.
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Confident
    priority: MUST
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: BURR_004
    speaker: Burrows
    subtitle: Aha. Blood.
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Curious
    priority: MUST
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: BURR_005
    speaker: Burrows
    subtitle: Strawberry.
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Surprised
    priority: MUST
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: BELL_003
    speaker: Bellamy
    subtitle: Strawberry?
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Confused
    priority: MUST
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: BURR_006
    speaker: Burrows
    subtitle: Raspberry makes a more convincing arterial effect.
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Smug
    priority: MUST
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: BELL_004
    speaker: Bellamy
    subtitle: Inspector, please look at her.
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Concerned
    priority: MUST
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: BURR_007
    speaker: Burrows
    subtitle: Odette? The performance has gone on quite long enough.
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Concerned
    priority: MUST
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: BELL_005
    speaker: Bellamy
    subtitle: She isn't moving.
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Concerned
    priority: MUST
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: BURR_008
    speaker: Burrows
    subtitle: Good heavens. Someone has murdered the victim.
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Shocked
    priority: MUST
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: BELL_006
    speaker: Bellamy
    subtitle: Yes, Inspector.
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Dry
    priority: MUST
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: BURR_009
    speaker: Burrows
    subtitle: Before the murder.
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Shocked
    priority: MUST
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: BURR_010
    speaker: Burrows
    subtitle: We had better start again.
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Serious
    priority: MUST
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: BURR_011
    speaker: Burrows
    subtitle: Mr. Mercer, where were you at approximately half past eight?
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Serious
    priority: MUST
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: FELI_001
    speaker: Felix
    subtitle: At the bar.
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Defensive
    priority: MUST
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: BURR_012
    speaker: Burrows
    subtitle: Can anyone confirm that?
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Curious
    priority: MUST
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: FELI_002
    speaker: Felix
    subtitle: I've got the receipt.
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Neutral
    priority: MUST
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: BURR_013
    speaker: Burrows
    subtitle: Champagne. An expensive taste.
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Smug
    priority: MUST
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: FELI_003
    speaker: Felix
    subtitle: Wasn't mine. Odette was paying.
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Defensive
    priority: MUST
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: BURR_014
    speaker: Burrows
    subtitle: And you remained there?
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Serious
    priority: MUST
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: FELI_004
    speaker: Felix
    subtitle: I was drinking, Inspector. Not posing for a portrait.
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Annoyed
    priority: MUST
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: BURR_015
    speaker: Burrows
    subtitle: Where were you before we discovered her?
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Serious
    priority: MUST
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: BELL_007
    speaker: Bellamy
    subtitle: Walking through the sleeping carriage.
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Neutral
    priority: MUST
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: BURR_016
    speaker: Burrows
    subtitle: Did you notice anything?
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Curious
    priority: MUST
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: BELL_008
    speaker: Bellamy
    subtitle: A sharp noise, then a crash. From Odette's end of the corridor.
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Neutral
    priority: MUST
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: BURR_017
    speaker: Burrows
    subtitle: You didn't investigate?
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Serious
    priority: MUST
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: BELL_009
    speaker: Bellamy
    subtitle: She forbade interruptions. I believed she was rehearsing.
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Defensive
    priority: MUST
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: BURR_018
    speaker: Burrows
    subtitle: A very convenient belief.
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Smug
    priority: MUST
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: BELL_010
    speaker: Bellamy
    subtitle: It was considerably more convenient before she died.
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Subdued
    priority: MUST
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: BURR_019
    speaker: Burrows
    subtitle: Miss Novak, where were you at half past eight?
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Serious
    priority: MUST
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: MILA_001
    speaker: Mila
    subtitle: Rehearsing! In my compartment.
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Polite
    priority: MUST
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: BURR_020
    speaker: Burrows
    subtitle: Alone?
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Curious
    priority: MUST
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: MILA_002
    speaker: Mila
    subtitle: Entirely. Not even a mouse.
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Cheerful
    priority: MUST
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: BURR_021
    speaker: Burrows
    subtitle: What were you rehearsing?
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Curious
    priority: MUST
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: MILA_003
    speaker: Mila
    subtitle: My death scene. One must prepare for opportunity.
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Cheerful
    priority: MUST
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: BURR_022
    speaker: Burrows
    subtitle: Did you visit Odette later?
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Serious
    priority: MUST
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: MILA_004
    speaker: Mila
    subtitle: Only earlier, for the fake blood. Terribly sticky stuff.
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Polite
    priority: MUST
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: BURR_023
    speaker: Burrows
    subtitle: And after that?
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Serious
    priority: MUST
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: MILA_005
    speaker: Mila
    subtitle: I left her to prepare. She was very excited.
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Nervous
    priority: MUST
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: BURR_024
    speaker: Burrows
    subtitle: You were near Odette's compartment when the real injury occurred.
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Serious
    priority: MUST
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: MILA_006
    speaker: Mila
    subtitle: I didn't murder her.
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Defensive
    priority: MUST
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: BURR_025
    speaker: Burrows
    subtitle: The clock, your account of the fall, and your changing alibi tell a
      different story about that evening.
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Serious
    priority: MUST
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: MILA_007
    speaker: Mila
    subtitle: It was an argument. She said I had to let her go.
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Subdued
    priority: MUST
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: BURR_026
    speaker: Burrows
    subtitle: What happened next?
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Serious
    priority: MUST
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: MILA_008
    speaker: Mila
    subtitle: I slapped her. She stumbled, and her head struck the desk. I couldn't
      wake her.
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Subdued
    priority: MUST
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: BURR_027
    speaker: Burrows
    subtitle: And the dagger?
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Serious
    priority: MUST
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: MILA_009
    speaker: Mila
    subtitle: I thought if somebody found her with it, they'd think she was rehearsing.
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Subdued
    priority: MUST
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: BURR_028
    speaker: Burrows
    subtitle: You knew she needed help.
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Serious
    priority: MUST
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: MILA_010
    speaker: Mila
    subtitle: I was frightened.
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Sad
    priority: MUST
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: BURR_029
    speaker: Burrows
    subtitle: You could have called someone.
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Serious
    priority: MUST
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: MILA_011
    speaker: Mila
    subtitle: I know.
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Sad
    priority: MUST
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: MILA_012
    speaker: Mila
    subtitle: She was supposed to wake up.
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Sad
    priority: MUST
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: BURR_030
    speaker: Burrows
    subtitle: You will have to tell the authorities what happened.
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Serious
    priority: MUST
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: BURR_031
    speaker: Burrows
    subtitle: The blood is counterfeit. Who was entrusted with the manufacture of
      this ghastly confection?
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Confident
    priority: SHOULD
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: BELL_011
    speaker: Bellamy
    subtitle: Miss Novak. She and Odette spent an extraordinary amount of time arguing
      about strawberries.
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Annoyed
    priority: SHOULD
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: BURR_032
    speaker: Burrows
    subtitle: And you watched them prepare it?
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Curious
    priority: SHOULD
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: BELL_012
    speaker: Bellamy
    subtitle: I saw the materials. I was not invited to lick the evidence.
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Disgusted
    priority: SHOULD
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: BURR_033
    speaker: Burrows
    subtitle: This clock stopped at twenty minutes to nine, give or take a few minutes.
      You heard a crash near then?
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Serious
    priority: MUST
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: BELL_013
    speaker: Bellamy
    subtitle: A sharp sound, then a crash. I couldn't tell you what made either noise.
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Neutral
    priority: MUST
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: BURR_034
    speaker: Burrows
    subtitle: Did you look inside?
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Curious
    priority: MUST
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: BELL_014
    speaker: Bellamy
    subtitle: No. Odette had forbidden interruptions. I assumed it was part of the
      performance.
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Defensive
    priority: MUST
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: BURR_035
    speaker: Burrows
    subtitle: So you heard something. You did not see it.
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Serious
    priority: MUST
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: BELL_015
    speaker: Bellamy
    subtitle: At last, a statement with which I can agree.
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Relieved
    priority: MUST
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: BURR_036
    speaker: Burrows
    subtitle: That clock was damaged before the scheduled discovery. Do you know
      how?
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Curious
    priority: SHOULD
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: MILA_013
    speaker: Mila
    subtitle: Odette knocked things over all the time. You should have seen what
      happened to the champagne glasses.
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Nervous
    priority: SHOULD
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: BURR_037
    speaker: Burrows
    subtitle: Did she break the clock?
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Serious
    priority: SHOULD
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: MILA_014
    speaker: Mila
    subtitle: Perhaps. She was terribly busy preparing her surprise.
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Polite
    priority: SHOULD
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: BURR_038
    speaker: Burrows
    subtitle: Perhaps is not the same as yes.
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Serious
    priority: SHOULD
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: MILA_015
    speaker: Mila
    subtitle: No, Inspector. Of course it isn't.
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Nervous
    priority: SHOULD
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: BURR_039
    speaker: Burrows
    subtitle: You speak as if you remember a fall, Miss Novak.
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Serious
    priority: MUST
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: MILA_016
    speaker: Mila
    subtitle: I'm only imagining it. This whole business has made my imagination
      rather unhelpful.
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Defensive
    priority: MUST
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: BURR_040
    speaker: Burrows
    subtitle: Then tell me what you actually saw.
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Serious
    priority: MUST
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: MILA_017
    speaker: Mila
    subtitle: I saw her earlier, when we prepared the syrup. That's all.
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Nervous
    priority: MUST
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: BURR_041
    speaker: Burrows
    subtitle: An imagination can be mistaken. A memory has a source.
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Serious
    priority: MUST
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: MILA_018
    speaker: Mila
    subtitle: Then perhaps I've mistaken the two.
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Subdued
    priority: MUST
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: BURR_042
    speaker: Burrows
    subtitle: You heard a crash and obeyed a printed instruction instead of checking
      on your friend?
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Serious
    priority: SHOULD
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: BELL_016
    speaker: Bellamy
    subtitle: Odette had threatened to expel anyone who interrupted her preparations.
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Annoyed
    priority: SHOULD
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: BURR_043
    speaker: Burrows
    subtitle: A threat you considered binding?
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Curious
    priority: SHOULD
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: BELL_017
    speaker: Bellamy
    subtitle: From Odette? Entirely. Last year she dismissed a violinist for sneezing
      in the wrong key.
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Dry
    priority: SHOULD
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: BURR_044
    speaker: Burrows
    subtitle: A serious musical offense.
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Confident
    priority: SHOULD
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: BURR_045
    speaker: Burrows
    subtitle: Champagne charged to Madame Vesper. What exactly were you celebrating?
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Curious
    priority: MUST
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: FELI_005
    speaker: Felix
    subtitle: You'd turn it into something ugly.
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Defensive
    priority: MUST
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: BURR_046
    speaker: Burrows
    subtitle: Try me.
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Serious
    priority: MUST
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: FELI_006
    speaker: Felix
    subtitle: We were going to marry. Odette and me.
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Subdued
    priority: MUST
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: BURR_047
    speaker: Burrows
    subtitle: You were engaged?
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Shocked
    priority: MUST
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: FELI_007
    speaker: Felix
    subtitle: Yes. She bought the drinks. I bought the rings.
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Sad
    priority: MUST
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: BURR_048
    speaker: Burrows
    subtitle: My condolences, Mr. Mercer.
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Serious
    priority: MUST
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: BURR_049
    speaker: Burrows
    subtitle: A peacock and a lion. These rings were made for you and Odette?
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Curious
    priority: MUST
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: FELI_008
    speaker: Felix
    subtitle: I had them made. I used my own savings, before you ask.
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Defensive
    priority: MUST
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: BURR_050
    speaker: Burrows
    subtitle: I hadn't asked.
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Neutral
    priority: MUST
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: FELI_009
    speaker: Felix
    subtitle: You were going to.
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Defensive
    priority: MUST
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: BURR_051
    speaker: Burrows
    subtitle: And were you happy together?
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Serious
    priority: MUST
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: FELI_010
    speaker: Felix
    subtitle: I wanted breakfast with her tomorrow. And the day after that.
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Sad
    priority: MUST
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: BURR_052
    speaker: Burrows
    subtitle: You gave Miss Novak a pin and kept two rings. Is this an unusually
      elaborate courtship?
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Confident
    priority: SHOULD
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: FELI_011
    speaker: Felix
    subtitle: It was a safety pin. Her rabbit mask kept falling off.
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Annoyed
    priority: SHOULD
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: BURR_053
    speaker: Burrows
    subtitle: An intimate gift.
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Confident
    priority: SHOULD
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: FELI_012
    speaker: Felix
    subtitle: It came from my cuff. You make everything sound filthy.
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Annoyed
    priority: SHOULD
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: BURR_054
    speaker: Burrows
    subtitle: I prefer the term thorough.
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Smug
    priority: SHOULD
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: BURR_055
    speaker: Burrows
    subtitle: These rings explain why Odette was arranging her life differently.
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Serious
    priority: MUST
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: BELL_018
    speaker: Bellamy
    subtitle: She had begun delegating work she once insisted on doing herself.
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Neutral
    priority: MUST
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: BURR_056
    speaker: Burrows
    subtitle: You resented that.
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Curious
    priority: MUST
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: BELL_019
    speaker: Bellamy
    subtitle: I resented having a sensible arrangement dismantled without discussion.
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Defensive
    priority: MUST
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: BURR_057
    speaker: Burrows
    subtitle: Did you argue with her?
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Serious
    priority: MUST
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: BELL_020
    speaker: Bellamy
    subtitle: Yes. Earlier that evening. We argued, and I left her alive.
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Subdued
    priority: MUST
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: BURR_058
    speaker: Burrows
    subtitle: You knew about the engagement?
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Curious
    priority: SHOULD
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: MILA_019
    speaker: Mila
    subtitle: Odette told me herself. Isn't that lovely? Two rings, two very determined
      people.
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Polite
    priority: SHOULD
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: BURR_059
    speaker: Burrows
    subtitle: Were you pleased?
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Serious
    priority: SHOULD
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: MILA_020
    speaker: Mila
    subtitle: Of course. We spent ages on the invitations for her pretend murder,
      though. The lettering alone took all afternoon.
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Nervous
    priority: SHOULD
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: BURR_060
    speaker: Burrows
    subtitle: I asked about the wedding.
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Serious
    priority: SHOULD
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: MILA_021
    speaker: Mila
    subtitle: I was happy for them, Inspector.
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Subdued
    priority: SHOULD
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: BURR_061
    speaker: Burrows
    subtitle: You insist you were alone during preparations. Did you leave your compartment?
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Serious
    priority: MUST
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: MILA_022
    speaker: Mila
    subtitle: I was practicing my death scene. Very little movement was required.
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Polite
    priority: MUST
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: BURR_062
    speaker: Burrows
    subtitle: An enviable role for a tired performer.
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Dry
    priority: MUST
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: MILA_023
    speaker: Mila
    subtitle: Odette said nobody should disturb her. So I didn't.
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Defensive
    priority: MUST
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: BURR_063
    speaker: Burrows
    subtitle: That isn't quite the question I asked.
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Serious
    priority: MUST
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: MILA_024
    speaker: Mila
    subtitle: It's the answer I have, Inspector.
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Subdued
    priority: MUST
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: BURR_064
    speaker: Burrows
    subtitle: Did anyone pass Odette's end of the corridor after you left the bar?
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Serious
    priority: MUST
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: FELI_013
    speaker: Felix
    subtitle: Mila did. I saw her walking away from that end of the carriage.
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Neutral
    priority: MUST
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: BURR_065
    speaker: Burrows
    subtitle: Coming out of Odette's door?
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Curious
    priority: MUST
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: FELI_014
    speaker: Felix
    subtitle: I didn't see the door. Don't put words in my mouth.
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Annoyed
    priority: MUST
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: BURR_066
    speaker: Burrows
    subtitle: Roughly when?
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Serious
    priority: MUST
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: FELI_015
    speaker: Felix
    subtitle: About a quarter to nine. I was on my way back from the bar.
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Neutral
    priority: MUST
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: BURR_067
    speaker: Burrows
    subtitle: You described where Odette fell. Yet you maintain you never returned.
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Serious
    priority: MUST
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: MILA_025
    speaker: Mila
    subtitle: Everyone saw the room after the discovery, didn't they?
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Nervous
    priority: MUST
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: BURR_068
    speaker: Burrows
    subtitle: You described the direction of her fall before I described it to you.
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Serious
    priority: MUST
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: MILA_026
    speaker: Mila
    subtitle: I only meant the desk. She was always stumbling into things.
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Defensive
    priority: MUST
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: BURR_069
    speaker: Burrows
    subtitle: You are correcting details I never gave you.
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Serious
    priority: MUST
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: MILA_027
    speaker: Mila
    subtitle: Then I've said it badly. I'm sorry.
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Subdued
    priority: MUST
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: BURR_070
    speaker: Burrows
    subtitle: You say you only visited Odette to help with the stage blood.
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Serious
    priority: SHOULD
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: MILA_028
    speaker: Mila
    subtitle: We tried strawberry syrup, then raspberry. The raspberry stained everything,
      and the cornflour made terrible lumps.
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Polite
    priority: SHOULD
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: BURR_071
    speaker: Burrows
    subtitle: After that visit?
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Curious
    priority: SHOULD
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: MILA_029
    speaker: Mila
    subtitle: Then there was the tablecloth. It looked like a butcher had married
      a jam-maker.
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Cheerful
    priority: SHOULD
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: BURR_072
    speaker: Burrows
    subtitle: Miss Novak. After that visit?
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Serious
    priority: SHOULD
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: MILA_030
    speaker: Mila
    subtitle: I went to practice alone.
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Defensive
    priority: SHOULD
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: BURR_073
    speaker: Burrows
    subtitle: Explain why a violent noise didn't alarm you.
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Serious
    priority: SHOULD
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: BELL_021
    speaker: Bellamy
    subtitle: Because we had been told not to interfere with the rehearsal. Very
      emphatically.
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Annoyed
    priority: SHOULD
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: BURR_074
    speaker: Burrows
    subtitle: A rule more important than a woman's safety?
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Serious
    priority: SHOULD
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: BELL_022
    speaker: Bellamy
    subtitle: At the time, Inspector, I thought I was preserving her peace. I was
      wrong.
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Subdued
    priority: SHOULD
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: BURR_075
    speaker: Burrows
    subtitle: You told me Odette could not have reached the clock from where she
      fell.
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Serious
    priority: MUST
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 1
  - id: MILA_031
    speaker: Mila
    subtitle: I said I was guessing.
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Defensive
    priority: MUST
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: BURR_076
    speaker: Burrows
    subtitle: You guessed the position of her body, not merely that she fell.
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Serious
    priority: MUST
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 1
  - id: MILA_032
    speaker: Mila
    subtitle: Everyone knew her desk was crowded.
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Nervous
    priority: MUST
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: BURR_077
    speaker: Burrows
    subtitle: A crowded desk would not tell you which way she fell.
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Serious
    priority: MUST
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 1
  - id: MILA_033
    speaker: Mila
    subtitle: I have nothing more to add, Inspector.
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Subdued
    priority: MUST
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: BURR_078
    speaker: Burrows
    subtitle: You said Odette often knocked things over. Could she have damaged her
      desk in a fall?
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Serious
    priority: MUST
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: MILA_034
    speaker: Mila
    subtitle: Perhaps. But she could hardly have reached the clock from where she
      fell.
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Nervous
    priority: MUST
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: BURR_079
    speaker: Burrows
    subtitle: From where she fell?
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Serious
    priority: MUST
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: MILA_035
    speaker: Mila
    subtitle: Oh. I only meant that she must have fallen. Surely?
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Defensive
    priority: MUST
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: BURR_080
    speaker: Burrows
    subtitle: You described her position. I never told you how she landed.
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Serious
    priority: MUST
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: MILA_036
    speaker: Mila
    subtitle: Then I must have imagined it. I have imagined a great deal lately.
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Subdued
    priority: MUST
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: FELIX_REACT_DISMISS_01
    speaker: Felix
    subtitle: You've got to be joking.
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Annoyed
    priority: MUST
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: FELIX_REACT_QUESTION_01
    speaker: Felix
    subtitle: What are you getting at?
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Defensive
    priority: MUST
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: FELIX_REACT_PRIVACY_01
    speaker: Felix
    subtitle: That's none of your business.
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Defensive
    priority: MUST
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: FELIX_REACT_SERIOUS_01
    speaker: Felix
    subtitle: I don't know what happened in that room.
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Sad
    priority: MUST
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: BELL_REACT_DISMISS_01
    speaker: Bellamy
    subtitle: Preposterous.
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Annoyed
    priority: MUST
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: BELL_REACT_QUESTION_01
    speaker: Bellamy
    subtitle: I fail to see the relevance.
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Neutral
    priority: MUST
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: BELL_REACT_DEFLECT_01
    speaker: Bellamy
    subtitle: That is an extraordinary assumption.
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Defensive
    priority: MUST
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: BELL_REACT_SERIOUS_01
    speaker: Bellamy
    subtitle: I heard a noise. I did not see what happened.
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Serious
    priority: MUST
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: MILA_REACT_DISMISS_01
    speaker: Mila
    subtitle: Oh, Inspector, what an imagination!
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Amused
    priority: MUST
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: MILA_REACT_QUESTION_01
    speaker: Mila
    subtitle: I'm not sure I understand.
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Neutral
    priority: MUST
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: MILA_REACT_DEFLECT_01
    speaker: Mila
    subtitle: Oh, that reminds me of the rehearsals!
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Nervous
    priority: MUST
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: MILA_REACT_SERIOUS_01
    speaker: Mila
    subtitle: I only know what I've already told you.
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Nervous
    priority: MUST
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: BURR_081
    speaker: Burrows
    subtitle: I have a question, Mr. Mercer.
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Curious
    priority: MUST
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: BURR_082
    speaker: Burrows
    subtitle: I have a question, Miss Novak.
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Curious
    priority: MUST
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: BURR_083
    speaker: Burrows
    subtitle: I have a question, Mr. Bellamy.
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Curious
    priority: MUST
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: BURR_ALT_01
    speaker: Burrows
    subtitle: You say Odette had a habit of knocking things over. What about her
      damaged writing desk?
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Serious
    priority: MUST
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: MILA_ALT_02
    speaker: Mila
    subtitle: She could have fallen against it. Though not from that side, with the
      clock in the way.
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Nervous
    priority: MUST
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: BURR_ALT_03
    speaker: Burrows
    subtitle: What side?
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Serious
    priority: MUST
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: MILA_ALT_04
    speaker: Mila
    subtitle: Whichever side it was. I was only guessing.
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Defensive
    priority: MUST
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: BURR_ALT_05
    speaker: Burrows
    subtitle: You seem unusually sure of a fall you say you never witnessed.
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Serious
    priority: MUST
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: MILA_ALT_06
    speaker: Mila
    subtitle: Oh, Inspector. I wish I had never said anything.
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Subdued
    priority: MUST
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: NEW_01_01
    speaker: Burrows
    subtitle: These rings carry a lion and a peacock. An exceedingly expensive zoological
      partnership.
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Curious
    priority: MUST
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: NEW_01_02
    speaker: Felix
    subtitle: They are for Odette and me.
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Subdued
    priority: MUST
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: NEW_01_03
    speaker: Burrows
    subtitle: An engagement?
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Surprised
    priority: MUST
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: NEW_01_04
    speaker: Felix
    subtitle: Yes. I bought them myself, before you ask. We were going to marry.
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Serious
    priority: MUST
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: NEW_01_05
    speaker: Burrows
    subtitle: Then the champagne was a celebration.
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Serious
    priority: MUST
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: NEW_01_06
    speaker: Felix
    subtitle: It was supposed to be.
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Sad
    priority: MUST
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: NEW_02_01
    speaker: Burrows
    subtitle: You say you were at the bar. Did you leave it at any point?
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Serious
    priority: MUST
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: NEW_02_02
    speaker: Felix
    subtitle: I went back toward the compartments later.
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Defensive
    priority: MUST
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: NEW_02_03
    speaker: Burrows
    subtitle: Did you see anyone?
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Curious
    priority: MUST
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: NEW_02_04
    speaker: Felix
    subtitle: "Mila. Near Odette\u2019s end of the carriage. I think it was quarter
      to nine."
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Neutral
    priority: MUST
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: NEW_02_05
    speaker: Burrows
    subtitle: And you neglected to mention that?
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Serious
    priority: MUST
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: NEW_02_06
    speaker: Felix
    subtitle: I thought everybody was running about rehearsing.
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Defensive
    priority: MUST
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: NEW_03_01
    speaker: Burrows
    subtitle: These preparations seem to have required an extraordinary amount of
      equipment.
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Curious
    priority: SHOULD
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: NEW_03_02
    speaker: Felix
    subtitle: Tell me about it. Mila had me hunting for a safety pin before dinner.
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Neutral
    priority: SHOULD
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: NEW_03_03
    speaker: Burrows
    subtitle: For what purpose?
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Serious
    priority: SHOULD
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: NEW_03_04
    speaker: Felix
    subtitle: Her rabbit mask. The ribbon kept coming loose.
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Neutral
    priority: SHOULD
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: NEW_04_01
    speaker: Burrows
    subtitle: You insist Odette wanted privacy, yet you spoke to her shortly before
      the performance.
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Serious
    priority: MUST
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: NEW_04_02
    speaker: Bellamy
    subtitle: We had a disagreement. I left when she told me to.
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Annoyed
    priority: MUST
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: NEW_04_03
    speaker: Burrows
    subtitle: Concerning?
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Curious
    priority: MUST
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: NEW_04_04
    speaker: Bellamy
    subtitle: She was handing away responsibilities she had spent decades accumulating.
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Serious
    priority: MUST
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: NEW_04_05
    speaker: Burrows
    subtitle: And you objected.
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Serious
    priority: MUST
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: NEW_04_06
    speaker: Bellamy
    subtitle: I objected to being made dispensable without so much as a memorandum.
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Embarrassed
    priority: MUST
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: NEW_05_01
    speaker: Burrows
    subtitle: A broken clock and a prohibition on interruptions. Why ignore a crash?
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Serious
    priority: SHOULD
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: NEW_05_02
    speaker: Bellamy
    subtitle: Because I thought it was part of the wretched performance.
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Annoyed
    priority: SHOULD
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: NEW_05_03
    speaker: Burrows
    subtitle: You were certain?
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Curious
    priority: SHOULD
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: NEW_05_04
    speaker: Bellamy
    subtitle: No, Inspector. That is what a mistake is.
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Annoyed
    priority: SHOULD
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: NEW_06_01
    speaker: Burrows
    subtitle: The theatrical blood appears to have required considerable preparation.
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Curious
    priority: SHOULD
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: NEW_06_02
    speaker: Bellamy
    subtitle: Miss Novak assisted Odette. It was apparently a substantial undertaking.
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Neutral
    priority: SHOULD
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: NEW_06_03
    speaker: Burrows
    subtitle: Did you help?
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Curious
    priority: SHOULD
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: NEW_06_04
    speaker: Bellamy
    subtitle: I declined to participate in the manufacture of confectionery homicide.
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Annoyed
    priority: SHOULD
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: NEW_07_01
    speaker: Burrows
    subtitle: The clock is broken. You say Odette seemed pleased when you last saw
      her.
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Serious
    priority: MUST
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: NEW_07_02
    speaker: Mila
    subtitle: Odette was always knocking things over. Perhaps she broke it herself.
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Nervous
    priority: MUST
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: NEW_07_03
    speaker: Burrows
    subtitle: A possibility. When did you see her last?
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Curious
    priority: MUST
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: NEW_07_04
    speaker: Mila
    subtitle: Before dinner, Inspector. I told you.
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Neutral
    priority: MUST
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: NEW_08_01
    speaker: Burrows
    subtitle: A lion and a peacock. Their relationship was more than a costume joke.
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Serious
    priority: SHOULD
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: NEW_08_02
    speaker: Mila
    subtitle: Yes. Odette told me. I was happy for them.
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Pleasant
    priority: SHOULD
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: NEW_08_03
    speaker: Burrows
    subtitle: And you kept that to yourself?
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Curious
    priority: SHOULD
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: NEW_08_04
    speaker: Mila
    subtitle: She trusted me, Inspector. I did not think it was mine to announce.
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Subdued
    priority: SHOULD
    recordingStatus: To record
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: MILA_CANON_SPATIAL_01
    speaker: Mila
    subtitle: Perhaps she fell. But she could hardly have reached the clock from
      where she fell.
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Nervous
    priority: MUST
    recordingStatus: "Canon correction \u2014 needs new recording"
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: BURR_CANON_SPATIAL_01
    speaker: Burrows
    subtitle: From where she fell?
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Serious
    priority: MUST
    recordingStatus: "Canon correction \u2014 needs new recording"
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: MILA_CANON_SPATIAL_02
    speaker: Mila
    subtitle: I was only guessing, Inspector.
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Defensive
    priority: MUST
    recordingStatus: "Canon correction \u2014 needs new recording"
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: MILA_CANON_FINALE_01
    speaker: Mila
    subtitle: I slapped her. She stumbled, and her head struck the heavy clock on
      her desk. I couldn't wake her.
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Subdued
    priority: MUST
    recordingStatus: "Canon correction \u2014 needs new recording"
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: BURR_MMO_FINALE_01
    speaker: Burrows
    subtitle: The injury, your connection to the couple, and the sighting near Odette's
      compartment warrant an explanation.
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Serious
    priority: MUST
    recordingStatus: "New MMO finale bridge \u2014 needs recording"
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
  - id: BURR_NO_CHAT_01
    speaker: Burrows
    subtitle: Chit-chat? A waste of valuable time.
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    expression: Dismissive
    priority: MUST
    recordingStatus: "New player bark \u2014 needs recording"
    disclosesFallGeometry: 0
